            "detailed_description": "<strong>Welcome to the Duck Force, recruit!</strong><br><br>Experience an amazing adventure in the rough stone age, where the bunny people under rule of a maniacal leader strives for the absolute power.<br>Prove your skills in an epic air battle and show the crazy bunnies where a drake has his feathers!<br><br>In varied levels, you must be stronger, faster and more skilled than your insidious opponents.<br>Fly through dry deserts and rocky canyons full of challenges and evolve from a lame duck to a majestic flight artists.<br><br>At the end of each climate zone a powerful boss is waiting for you.<br>Will you be victorious at the end? <br><br>By the Duck Force, we count on you!",
